{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_025_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d50f12259053668caf0983a690ee9af86c33769c73ef188920a2e9c8855f0419",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bb5ff555f58ec824c616e07b3a2a779335de1c08698874432d48a953c340323",
      "text": "原来是这么回事！我明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb760e3d7e277d5afdd7cc5911e0c93b86e3b0db63b9fb5fe2e121efa45b739d",
      "text": "不过我记得玄武先生平时有自己做饭吧？\n应该不至于不擅长做料理才对？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cfba06c85c75c5c4a4210e88bc7d195bdf8efedf8acfb279bb2ebc6f4699333",
      "text": "算是吧。\n但一到松饼上就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:024840e75bd0f0e92ce72a8bec1e0a95a61cfae94e82206944d515c28ce15363",
      "text": "大概是因为常陪着朱雀去那些有名气的店，\n舌头也被养刁了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:785a3b550d3f3cdabb8762f76fe015b84e78f432a230cb62453fc274e4d349ce",
      "text": "怎么也做不出能让我满意的味道。\n虽说积土成山，我也在不断反复尝试就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0afa4fb42772308d7d98132a8e07d1dbf5b19d3ddd494c54b172995a1e0a246",
      "text": "多亏这个，这段时间每天晚上，\n饭吃的都是试做的松饼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ad1c088731a0507dfff248e20523c530a4a3abe8a5f69cbdf283496104e154e",
      "text": "既然这样，要不要向英雄先生请教一下？\n他很懂怎么做松饼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:232bc26fe53b75115aa056f0e45fa73adb99b327e1712c957db16d1fe2b818e4",
      "text": "英雄大哥？那我还真是头一次听说。\n谢了。回头我试着联系他看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9b13709029462b365b87dafd91776758b473f56ef98053e7d389c12c2be20f2",
      "text": "好的。顺便问一下，为了不让朱雀先生担心，\n我能先在不穿帮的程度内跟他聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c10bf4ab572e66c685d99d6fe4a39e9a1c5ca2aedc99f035206f7ee0fa260f",
      "text": "那件事我也一直挂在心上。\n就交托给番长了。多谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e576bc92f61836df87466ef15fcaea04a2b2805d6968ce09466b55a1753b027",
      "text": "希望当天能过一个美好的生日呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6949d1a08153b3b798fda86daecfd5ac6a4307d08570f11f829bbfec8935db4",
      "text": "啊啊。……对了番长。\n顺便还有件事，能帮我个忙吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
